  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "那邊那位強大的訓練家，\n我們進了很好的大蔥喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3908A90A34F4D5F37592776848A137DF45BB6FF0C000A6211501190324E865F88597D7684592785255594FF0100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道大蔥鴨\n這種寶可夢嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E59053592785259D28000A90197A2E5BF653EF592255CEFF1F00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠總是拿著植物的莖，\n有時會當作武器揮舞。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72607E3D662F62FF8457690D726976848396FF0C000A67096642670375764F5C6B66566863EE821E300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是說關於大蔥鴨和大蔥\n也有個令人不安的傳聞……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8AAA95DC65BC592785259D28548C59278525000A4E5F6709500B4EE44EBA4E0D5B89768450B3805E2026202600100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說在晚上……讓1隻大蔥鴨攜帶大蔥，\n然後帶著牠去某個地方的話，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n會有不法之徒來夜襲。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA5728665A4E0A202620268B93003196BB592785259D28651C5E3659278525FF0C000A71365F8C5E368457726053BB67D0500B573065B976848A71FF0C00100001BE00000A670367094E0D6CD54E4B5F924F86591C8972300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位強大的訓練家，\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳反過來將那個不法之徒打倒吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我把大蔥奉送給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D5F37592776848A137DF45BB6FF0C000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B353CD904E4F865C0790A3500B4E0D6CD54E4B5F92625350125427300200100001BE00000A6211628A59278525594990017D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了反過來將不法之徒打倒，\n請在<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>晚上<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>只帶著1隻攜帶著<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>大蔥<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>大蔥鴨<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n前往<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>榴紅7號街區<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的巷子。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 28,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
