      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\n想起了委託人說的話……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n為了反過來將不法之徒打倒，\n請在<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>晚上<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>只帶著1隻攜帶著<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>大蔥<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>大蔥鴨<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n前往<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>榴紅7號街區<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的巷子。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 31,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那根大蔥……是把好武器。\n我想讓同為大蔥鴨的牠們比劃比劃！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A368395927852520262026662F628A597D6B6656683002000A621160F38B93540C70BA592785259D287684726050116BD452836BD45283FF0100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦，什麼啊什麼啊，那根巨大的蔥是怎樣！？\n這不是伽勒爾的樣子的大蔥鴨嗎！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF0C4EC09EBC554A4EC09EBC554AFF0C90A368395DE8592776848525662F600E6A23FF01FF1F000A90194E0D662F4F3D52D2723E76846A235B507684592785259D2855CEFF0100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕哇！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549554C7FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呱哇！！",
