      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是我小看<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F62115C0F770B00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86FF0100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "面對突然的襲擊也不為所動的揮莖刀法……\n想必<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是位赫赫有名的訓練家。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "97625C0D7A8171367684897264CA4E5F4E0D70BA624052D5768463EE839652006CD520262026000A60F35FC500100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F4F4D8D6B8D6B6709540D76848A137DF45BB6300200100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能把他打倒，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳確實有兩把刷子呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD628A4ED662535012FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B378BA5BE667095169628A52375B505462300200100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯，在下也想要\n與<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來一場全力對戰。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF0C57284E0B4E5F60F38981000A820700100003110000FF01014F6059B34F864E0058345168529B5C0D6230300200100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "同志之敗即為在下之敗。\n就由在下來一雪此恥。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "540C5FD74E4B6557537370BA57284E0B4E4B65573002000A5C31753157284E0B4F864E0096EA6B646065300200100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "欸，稍等稍等……！\n居然是伽勒爾的大蔥鴨？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n可惡，即便如此也非上不可！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B38FF0C7A0D7B497A0D7B4920262026FF01000A5C457136662F4F3D52D2723E7684592785259D28FF1F00100001BE00000A53EF60E1FF0C53734FBF59826B644E5F975E4E0A4E0D53EFFF0100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
