      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是統領三人幫的伍世……\n換句話說，就是三人之中最強的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F7D7198184E094EBA5E6B76844F0D4E1620262026000A63DB53E58A718AAAFF0C5C31662F4E094EBA4E4B4E2D67005F377684300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳見識見識關都流的揮莖刀法吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3898B8B58898B8B5895DC90FD6D41768463EE839652006CD55427300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管對手是伽勒爾的大蔥鴨還是誰，\n都讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳見識見識關都流的揮莖刀法。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA15C0D624B662F4F3D52D2723E7684592785259D289084662F8AB0FF0C000A90FD8B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3898B8B58898B8B5895DC90FD6D41768463EE839652006CD5300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "做好覺悟吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2296,
