    },
    {
      "displayText": "然而若要實現，就得要有實力相當，\n足以和我們對決的大蔥鴨和訓練家。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136800C82E589815BE673FEFF0C5C315F97898167095BE6529B76F87576FF0C000A8DB34EE5548C621150115C0D6C7A7684592785259D28548C8A137DF45BB6300200100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是我找上了<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，\n並引導<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳前往巷子！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662F6211627E4E0A4E8600100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A4E265F155C0E00100003110000FF01014F6059B3524D5F805DF75B50FF0100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了帶出緊張氣氛，\n所以我沒有透露細節。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E865E3651FA7DCA5F356C236C1BFF0C000A62404EE562116C926709900F97327D307BC0300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但那麼做就像是騙了<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，\n真的萬分抱歉……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4690A39EBC505A5C3150CF662F9A194E8600100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A771F7684842C520662B16B492026202600100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過我們由衷感謝\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意幫忙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E6211501175318877611F8B1D000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F5E6B5FD9FF0100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！我嚮往已久的那句台詞……\n終於說出口了啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF01621156AE5F805DF24E45768490A353E553F08A5E20262026000A7D4265BC8AAA51FA53E34E86554A300200100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大蔥鴨們剛才也很投入呢。\n表現得非常到位。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592785259D285011525B624D4E5F5F886295516554623002000A886873FE5F97975E5E3852304F4D300200100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕哇！咕～哇呱哇！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549554C7FF015495FF5E54C7547154C7FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
